<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“Seed of Abraham,” Thou art, Lord,</l><l>By God’s promise Thou hast come,</l><l>That the blessing He hath promised</l><l>On all people thus might come.</l><l>Abraham Thou hast preceded,</l><l>For Thou art the great “I AM,”</l><l>Yet Thou cam’st to be his offspring</l><l>And become God’s promised “Lamb.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, Thou art the “Seed of David,”</l><l>For the kingdom Thou wast raised;</l><l>For God’s glory and His building</l><l>On the throne Thou hast been placed.</l><l>Truly Thou art “David’s offspring,”</l><l>Yet “my Lord” he calleth Thee,</l><l>For Thou art his “root” and fountain,</l><l>“Lord of all” eternally.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Though “a child” born with our nature,</l><l>Thou the “Mighty God” art called;</l><l>Thou, “a son” to us art given,</l><l>“Everlasting Father” called.</l><l>All the blessings God hath promised,</l><l>With our faith on Thee depend;</l><l>Thou art “Yea” and “Amen” for them,</l><l>All the content and the end!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
